# Every artefact in this directory is byte-compared: `build.py --check` rebuilds
# the catalogue and diffs it, and `raw_trace.jsonl` has to stay byte-identical in
# shape to cold-start-a0's producer, which writes with newline="\n".
#
# `core.autocrlf` is true on the machine this was built on.  Without this file
# the first commit normalises these files, the next Windows checkout materialises
# CRLF, and the traces silently stop matching.  Every sibling artefact directory
# in this repo pins the same thing.
* text eol=lf
*.jsonl text eol=lf
*.json  text eol=lf
*.md    text eol=lf
*.py    text eol=lf
